OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for driving van at four
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drove a van at four police
OL,7,Fofficers and injured one has been
OL,8,Fjailed for four years.
OL,10,FAaron Swanson, 28, hit PC Lucy
OL,11,FO'Donnell on the body after she ordered
OL,12,Fhim to stop his van and drove at
OL,13,Fexcessive speed towards other officers.
OL,15,FHe was originally charged with
OL,16,Fattempted murder following the incident
OL,17,Fin Clydebank on 5 January 2025, but was
OL,18,Fconvicted at the High Court at
OL,19,FLivingston of two less serious offences
OL,20,F- assault to injury and danger of life.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
