OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for driving van at four
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwanson was cleared of several motoring
OL,7,Foffences including failing to stop
OL,8,Fafter an accident, failing to stop for
OL,9,Fpolice and driving without a licence or
OL,10,Finsurance.
